{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22384","headline":"城上对月期友人不至 · 白居易","name":"城上对月期友人不至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人惜昼短，劝令秉烛游。\n况此迢迢夜，明月满西楼。\n复有盈尊酒，置在城上头。\n期君君不至，人月两悠悠。\n照水烟波白，照人肌发秋。\n清光正如此，不醉即须愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}